.
.  Create a GIF file for a dex Youden plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
SKIP 25
READ BOXCHEM.DAT Y X1 X2 X3 X4
.
TITLE SIZE 5
TIC LABEL SIZE 5
LABEL SIZE 5
CHARACTER 1 2 3 4
CHARACTER SIZE 5 ALL
LINE BLANK BLANK BLANK BLANK SOLID
Y1LABEL LOW LEVEL
X1LABEL HIGH LEVEL
.
PRE-ERASE OFF
MULTIPLOT 2 2
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 100
.
YTIC OFFSET 5 0
TITLE DEX YOUDEN MEAN PLOT
DEX MEAN YOUDEN PLOT Y X1 X2 X3 X4
TITLE DEX YOUDEN MEDIAN PLOT
DEX MEDIAN YOUDEN PLOT Y X1 X2 X3 X4
TITLE DEX YOUDEN SD PLOT
YTIC OFFSET 0 0
DEX SD YOUDEN PLOT Y X1 X2 X3 X4
TITLE DEX YOUDEN RANGE PLOT
YTIC OFFSET 0 5
DEX RANGE YOUDEN PLOT Y X1 X2 X3 X4
.
END OF MULTIPLOT
QUIT
